  "description": "A Native-AOT-compatible ASP.NET Core integration for CQRSharp with no MVC dependency. Maps CommandResult and CommandResult<T> to minimal-API IResult responses (200/201/204, or an RFC 7807 ProblemDetails whose status follows the result's error kind), registers an IExceptionHandler that turns the exceptions a dispatch throws (validation, duplicate request, idempotency key mismatch, rate limit, timeout, queue refusal) into ProblemDetails responses through the host's IProblemDetailsService, and reads and validates the Idempotency-Key request header.",
  "iconFile": "CQRSharp_Icon.png",
